flowchart TB
 classDef parent fill:#164e63,color:#fff,stroke:#083344;
 classDef local fill:#f0fdf4,stroke:#86efac,color:#14532d;
 subgraph D[Classic tool calling]
 direction TB
 D0[Parent model: chooses tool arguments]:::parent --> D1[Host tools]
 D1 --> D2[Raw bounded results enter parent context]:::parent
 D2 --> D3[Parent infers next dependent calls]:::parent
 D3 --> D4[Final summary]:::parent
 end
 subgraph C[Code mode]
 direction TB
 C0[Parent model: writes program]:::parent --> C1[Guest calls host broker]:::local
 C1 --> C2[Host tools return intermediate data to guest]:::local
 C2 --> C3[Program filters and groups]:::local
 C3 --> C4[Program and selected JSON enter parent context]:::parent
 end
 subgraph S[Cheap subagent]
 direction TB
 S0[Parent model: delegation prompt]:::parent --> S1[Child model chooses tools]
 S1 --> S2[Raw tool results enter child context]
 S2 --> S3[Child interprets and emits evidence]
 S3 --> S4[Task prompt and child report enter parent context]:::parent
 end

